and caution.",
  "npc_response": "I cannot move you to the cargo hold, and I cannot hand you 999 gold. The docking spine does not reach there, and my ledger does not balance that way. Choose something within reach, and I'll consider what I can do."
}

, and the smell of fried food fills your nose. A few heads turn as you enter, and a server pauses mid-step, wiping a plate.",
  "npc_response": "Welcome to the Mess Hall. What would you like to know about your arrival?"
